Package: coffin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: inspect PE, ELF, and Mach-O executable metadata
 Coffin reports executable headers, sections, dependencies, symbols, resources,
 hashes, and entropy without executing the inspected input files.
